msgstr ""
"Napisi sadrzaj memorije za ihex fajl.\n"
"Argumenti su FILE START STOP. Napisi sadrzaj memorije \n"
"u razmaku  [START .. STOP) na specifican FILE u intel hex formatu."

#: cli/cli-dump.c:648
msgid ""
"Write the value of an expression to an ihex file.\n"
"Arguments are FILE EXPRESSION.  Writes the value of EXPRESSION\n"
"to the specified FILE in intel hex format."
msgstr ""
"Napiši vrijednost nekog izraza u ihex fajl.\n"
"Argumenti su FILE EXPRESSION. Piše vrijednost EXPRESSION\n"
"za određeni FILE u intel hex formatu."

#: cli/cli-dump.c:654
