"Argumenti su DATOTEKA START STOP. Zapisuje sadržaj memorije unutar\n"
"Raspon [START .. STOP] na navedeni FILE u verilog hex formatu."

#: cli/cli-dump.c:660
msgid ""
"Write the value of an expression to a verilog hex file.\n"
"Arguments are FILE EXPRESSION.  Writes the value of EXPRESSION\n"
