#: cli/cli-cmds.c:2424
msgid ""
"Maintenance commands.\n"
"Some gdb commands are provided just for use by gdb maintainers.\n"
"These commands are subject to frequent change, and may not be as\n"
"well documented as user commands."
msgstr ""
"Održavanje naredbi.\n"
"Neke GDB naredbe se mogu koristiti samo od strane gdb održavaoca.\n"
"Te naredbe su podložne čestim promjenama, i nisu\n"
"dobro dokumentirane kao korisničke naredbe."

