#: go32-nat.c:2097
msgid ""
"Display entries in the LDT (Local Descriptor Table).\n"
"Entry number (an expression) as an argument means display only that entry."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži unose u LDT(Local Descriptor Table).\n"
"Broj unosa (izraz) je argument koji znači prikaži samo taj unos."

#: go32-nat.c:2101
msgid ""
"Display entries in the GDT (Global Descriptor Table).\n"
"Entry number (an expression) as an argument means display only that entry."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži unose iz GDT(Global Descriptor Table).\n"
"Broj unosa (kao izraz) je argument koji znači prikaži samo taj unos."

#: go32-nat.c:2105
msgid ""
"Display entries in the IDT (Interrupt Descriptor Table).\n"
"Entry number (an expression) as an argument means display only that entry."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži unose u IDT(Interrupt Descriptor Table).\n"
"Broj unosa (kao izraz) je argument koji znači prikaži samo taj unos."

#: go32-nat.c:2109
msgid ""
"Display entries in the Page Directory.\n"
"Entry number (an expression) as an argument means display only that entry."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži unose u Page Dictionary.\n"
"Broj unosa (kao izraz) je argumennt koji znači prikaži samo taj unos."

#: go32-nat.c:2113
msgid ""
"Display entries in Page Tables.\n"
"Entry number (an expression) as an argument means display only entries\n"
"from the Page Table pointed to by the specified Page Directory entry."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži unose u Page Tables.\n"
"Broj unosa (kao izraz) je argument koji znači prikaži samo unose\n"
"iz Page Table na koji pokazuje specificirani unos Page Directory."

#: go32-nat.c:2118
msgid ""
"Display a Page Table entry for a linear address.\n"
"The address argument must be a linear address, after adding to\n"
"it the base address of the appropriate segment.\n"
"The base address of variables and functions in the debuggee's data\n"
"or code segment is stored in the variable __djgpp_base_address,\n"
"so use `__djgpp_base_address + (char *)&var' as the argument.\n"
"For other segments, look up their base address in the output of\n"
"the `info dos ldt' command."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži unos Page Table za linearnu adresu.\n"
"Argument adrese mora biti linearna adresa, nakon dodavanja\n"
"baznoj adresi odgovarajućeg segmenta.\n"
"Bazna adresa varijabli i funkcija debagerskih podataka\n"
"ili segmenta kodaspremljenog u varijbli __djgpp_base_address,\n"
"pa koristi '__djgpp_base_address + (char *)&var' kao argument.\n"
"Za druge segmente, pogledaj njihove bazne adrese u outputu\n"
"'info dos ldt' komande"

