#: probe.c:912
msgid ""
"Enable probes.\n"
"Usage: enable probes [PROVIDER [NAME [OBJECT]]]\n"
"Each argument is a regular expression, used to select probes.\n"
"PROVIDER matches probe provider names.\n"
"NAME matches the probe names.\n"
"OBJECT matches the executable or shared library name.\n"
"If you do not specify any argument then the command will enable\n"
"all defined probes."
msgstr ""
"Omogući sonde.\n"
"Upotreba: omogućiti sonde [PROVAJDER [IME [OBJEKAT]]]\n"
"Svaki argument je regularni izraz, koji se koristi za odabir sondi.\n"
"PROVAJDER odgovara nazivu davatelja probama.\n"
"IMe odgovara nazivu sonde.\n"
"OBJEKAT odgovara izvršnom ili dijeljenom nazivu biblioteke.\n"
"Ako ne odredite bilo koji argument onda će naredba omogućiti\n"
"Sve definirane sonde."

#: probe.c:923
msgid ""
"Disable probes.\n"
"Usage: disable probes [PROVIDER [NAME [OBJECT]]]\n"
"Each argument is a regular expression, used to select probes.\n"
"PROVIDER matches probe provider names.\n"
"NAME matches the probe names.\n"
"OBJECT matches the executable or shared library name.\n"
"If you do not specify any argument then the command will disable\n"
"all defined probes."
msgstr ""
"Onemogući sonde.\n"
